gwsw:BALd rdfs:label "Defectieve reparatie - Vermindering, Breedte of Diepte"@nl, "Defective repair - Reduction or width"@en;
    rdfs:seeAlso "[EN13508-2+A1] Waar karakterisering 1 C, E of Z is, is de kwantificering de vermindering van de dwarsdoorsnede in procenten. Waar karakterisering 1 is G, is de breedte van de scheur of spleet in milimeters. Waar karakterisering 1 is A, B, D of F, is de lengte van het gat (in langsrichting) in milimeters."@nl, "[EN13508-2+A1] Where characterisation 1 is C, E or Z, the quantification is the reduction in cross-sectional area, expressed as a percentage. Where characterisation 1 is G the width of the crack or split in mm. Where characterisation 1 is A, B, D or F the length of the hole (along the axis of the pipe) in mm."@en;
    gwsw:hasAuthorStart "Marinus Vonhof";
    gwsw:hasDateStart "2012-08-15"^^xsd:date;
    gwsw:hasUnit "mm";
    rdfs:comment "[is aspect]";
    skos:scopeNote gwsw:Cof_EN;
    a owl:Class;
    rdfs:subClassOf gwsw:Kwantificering1, _:n3-10514, _:n3-10515.
