gwsw:DALd rdfs:label "Defectieve reparatie (put) - Vermindering of breedte"@nl, "Defective repair (manhole) - Reduction or width"@en;
    rdfs:seeAlso "[EN13508-2+A1] Where characterisation 1 is C, E or Z, the quantification is the reduction in cross-sectional area, expressed as a percentage. Where characterisation 1 is G the width of the crack or split in mm. Where characterisation 1 is A, B, D or F the length of the hole (along the axis of the pipe) in mm."@en, "[EN13508-2+A1] Waar karakterisering 1 C, E of Z is, is de kwantificering de vermindering van de dwarsdoorsnede in procenten. Waar karakterisering 1 is G, is de breedte van de scheur of spleet in milimeters. Waar karakterisering 1 is A, B, D of F, is de lengte van het gat (in asrichting) in milimeters."@nl;
    gwsw:hasAuthorStart "Marinus Vonhof";
    gwsw:hasDateStart "2012-08-15"^^xsd:date;
